<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Fee Reminder - The Clouds Academy</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: auto; padding: 20px; }
    .alert { background: #fef3c7; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 16px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Fee Payment Reminder</h2>
    <div class="alert">
      <p>Dear Parent,</p>
      <p>This is a reminder that the fee for <strong>{{studentName}}</strong> is due.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Voucher:</strong> {{voucherNumber}}</li>
        <li><strong>Amount:</strong> Rs. {{amount}}</li>
        <li><strong>Due Date:</strong> {{dueDate}}</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Please pay on time to avoid late fines.</p>
    </div>
    <p style="color: #888; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 20px;">The Clouds Academy Management</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
